                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The Location Table contains a unique LocationID for each area, mapping it to its corresponding Location Name and City. This table helps in analyzing trip patterns by identifying the most frequent pickup and drop-off locations. It also supports geographic-based insights and trends in ride demand.",
